    {
      "id": "mem_afe4b918fbec",
      "tenantId": "global",
      "projectId": "global",
      "category": "tech_stack",
      "title": "Architecture Blueprint & Engineering Stack",
      "content": "System Architecture & Technology Stack:\n1. Backend: Node.js (v20+), vanilla HTTP server, minimal dependencies for maximum reliability.\n2. Authorization: ReBAC graph authorization with granular access nodes and relations.\n3. Memory Engine: Hybrid episodic/semantic vector search stored in drisyon-memory.json with cosine similarity ranking.\n4. Frontend: Pure modern JavaScript (ES6+), semantic HTML5, and CSS custom properties (design tokens in dashboard.css).\n5. Testing: Built-in Node test runner (node --test) with strict zero-regression requirement (229+ passing tests).",
